  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GWP/OECD - regional water, 2012-2018 - Konsultst&#xf6;d CSR/J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GWP/OECD - regionala vatteninsatser, 2012-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome objective A: To increase awareness and knowledge of decision-makers and stakeholders on the conditions for PSP in the water sector at national and regional levels. Bridging Objective A.1 - National assessments on PSP in water infrastructure - Regional Report compiling the national cases Output objective A.2 - National assessments on PSP in water infrastructure - Regional Report compiling the national cases  
Outcome objective B: Enhanced intra-country coordination among actors involved in PSP. Bridging Objective B.1 Consultation meetings/workshops. Output objective B.2 - Elaboration of the national assessments through &#x2013;among other tools- the use of consultation meetings/workshops  
Outcome objective C: To promote actively the extensive dissemination of sustainable policies that address the water governance-financing nexus. Bridging Objective C.1 Dialogue processes at regional levels, compilation of good practice. Output objective C.2 - Dialogue processes at national and regional levels - Identification and compilation of good cases - Technical/analytical work at large 
Outcome objective D: Improved enabling environment for PSP - Policy change at national level. Bridging Objective D.1 Dialogue and technical work. Output objective D.2 Conduct of technical work  
Outcome objective E: Identification and dissemination of good practices and sharing of experiences. Bridging Objective E.1 Reports from regional workshops, compilation of these experiences. Output objective E.2 - Documents/Reports from Regional Workshops - Compilation of the Regional Report Outcome objective F: Aid effectiveness Bridging Objective F.1 Donor dialogue needed. Output objective F.2 - Financing modalities of the work</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet h&#xe5;ller p&#xe5; att formuleras men kommer att kopplas till den    vattenstrategi som tagits from inom unionen f&#xf6;r Medelhavet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proposal under development and it will be connected to the new        regional water strategy under the Uuion for the Mediterranean.</narrative>
  </description>
